error: `sendPieces` on a connection holds the thread until it is done, and an async function does not hold its thread
  the tasks of async functions share a few threads: one that holds its thread keeps the others from running
  --> error_net_send_pieces_blocking.sg:5:14
 5 |     try conn.sendPieces(read pieces)
   |              ^^^^^^^^^^
  hint: `await conn.sendPiecesAsync(read pieces)` does the same work without holding the thread
